  "observations": [
    "All12 full/face images show authored colors, outfit accessories and distinct weapons; five female designs and individual heights follow the source table. Portrait mode hides weapon groups and restores them in full view; H08 face is unobstructed. H11 strings face upward/front and held hand pose survives animation. Face-front UV is separated from the warm rear skull; hair has independent geometry. H05 optical mirror floats beside/behind the shoulder, and armor/weapon relief shares the character atlas. Topology and portrait construction remain shared procedural systems.",
    "The actual sanctuary has three jade steps, four dragon pillars, gate/clouds/mountains/petals and four studio lights. The battlefield portals now have three octagonal tiers, eight lamps, four curved carved pillars, energy links and a shader vortex; shops/altars have the new architecture. The gallery verifies live scene/light metadata and no WebGL or shader errors.",
    "Seven actual offline biome captures use the original coordinates, with AI disabled and player immune as stated in the gallery fixture. Terrain600/256 retains original coordinates and collision height. Each gallery biome waits for its actual2048PBR atlas from the bounded offline Worker. Seven128pxfallbacks and1-2highsets retain residency limits; grass400instances and portal states are measured.",
    "Water uses view-dependent procedural sky/moon reflection and analytic wave normals/Fresnel. The GPU comparison isolates the reflection signal at two camera angles; no scene-object reflection or SSR is claimed.",
    "Distinct four fauna and three original Boss previews use the gameplay art module in an isolated sanctuary fixture. Images do not prove encounter timing, combat behavior or physical-device performance."
  ],
