  "remainingArtWork": [
    "Full final fidelity remains unapproved: shared procedural facial/anatomical construction and simplified sculpting/material detail do not establish every art-direction detail or AAA quality.",
    "Representative cosmetic photos and geometry/material signatures do not replace individual review of all48 costumes/24 skins, every hand/rear angle and animation.",
    "Physical Android functional, performance and native attack traces are absent; fourth Boss and Tien khi source data remain reserved for the official specification."
  ],
